sequenceDiagram
 actor Patient
 participant API as FastAPI
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 Patient->>API: POST /bookings + Idempotency-Key
 API->>DB: Check existing key
 alt Existing key
 DB-->>API: Existing consultation
 API-->>Patient: Existing booking
 else New key
 API->>DB: Begin transaction and lock slot
 API->>DB: Mark booked; insert consultation and audit
 API->>DB: Commit
 API-->>Patient: Booking response
 end
